 "title": {
  "zh": "算例 1：Mo XXXVIII 2s²2p 和 2s2p²，逐层扩展与 E1 跃迁",
  "en": "Case 1: Mo XXXVIII 2s²2p and 2s2p², layer by layer, E1 transitions"
 },
 "summary": {
  "zh": "手册第一个完整算例，也是本程序各页的默认参数。奇宇称 2s²2p、2p³ 和偶宇称 2s2p² 分别从 Dirac-Fock 开始，用 rcsfsplit 把到 n = 6 的单、双激发列表按层拆分，逐层做 n = 3 到 6 的 MCDHF，再做含 Breit 和 QED 的 CI，最后计算 E1 跃迁。",
  "en": "The first complete case of the manual, also the default parameters of this program. Odd 2s²2p, 2p³ and even 2s2p² each start from Dirac-Fock; the list of single and double excitations to n = 6 is split into layers with rcsfsplit, MCDHF is done layer by layer for n = 3 to 6, then CI with Breit and QED, and finally the E1 transitions."
 },
 "runtime": {
  "zh": "单进程约 50 分钟",
  "en": "about 50 minutes serial"
 },
